# --- Secrets and credentials -------------------------------------------------
# Nothing in this repository may ever contain a Codeforces password, a session
# cookie, a Playwright storage state or a GitHub token. These patterns are a
# safety net; the real protection is that no code reads a credential from a file.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets.properties
credentials.json
storage_state.json
*storage-state*.json
playwright-state*.json
auth.json
cookies.json
cookies.txt

